{
    "background_story": "Kalani was a brilliant inventor with a mind full of innovative ideas. However, his creations often remained unvented, hidden away in his cluttered workshop. Despite his genius, Kalani struggled to share his work with the world, fearing criticism and rejection. His friends and family encouraged him to showcase his talents, but Kalani's self-doubt held him back. One day, a devastating hurricane hit his coastal town, and the community was in dire need of solutions. Kalani's unvented ideas were suddenly in high demand, and he was forced to reveal his creations. His innovative water purification system and makeshift shelters saved countless lives, earning him recognition and admiration. Kalani's story serves as a reminder that sometimes, it takes a little push to share our hidden talents with the world.",
